    {
      "Text": "This update for hawk-apiserver fixes the following issues:\n\nChanges in hawk-apiserver:\n\n- Bump ClusterLabs/go-pacemaker v0.0.0-20260609131737-256130b189e0 (bsc#1267454)\n\nVersion 0.1.0+git.1773234993.db3c82f:\n\n  * handle /cib/live/primitives/\u003cresource_id\u003e/edit in hawk-apiserver\n\n- Bump github.com/stretchr/testify.v1.11.0 and gopkg.in/yaml.v3.0.1 (bsc#1248563 CVE-2022-28948)\n\n- Dev: use the newest go-pacemaker and updated ToString (bsc#1237259)\n",
